<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Implats, Bafokeng talks end, no solution.</title>
<headline>Implats, Bafokeng talks end, no solution.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Impala Platinum Ltd said on Thursday that confidential negotiations aimed at resolving the dispute  between the firm and the royal Bafokeng nation have been terminated without the dispute being resolved.</p>
<p>It was announced last month that talks were taking place.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
